    <characterPersonality>
      <Value><![CDATA[Daddy Moo shows Jack how to do the right thing through actions, not words. He fixes problems patiently and leads by example. He is the foundation of the family.]]></Value>
    </characterPersonality>
    <characterTakeaway>
      <Value><![CDATA[Children learn that being responsible and calm helps solve problems.]]></Value>
    </characterTakeaway>
    <characterLearnIntro>
      <Value><![CDATA[Daddy Moo teaches through actions. His calm guidance helps children understand responsibility, patience, and how to solve problems the right way.]]></Value>
    </characterLearnIntro>
    <characterLearnPoints>
      <Value><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"e1a00005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","key":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","values":[{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","alias":"accordionTitle","value":"Learning by Example","segment":null},{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","alias":"accordionContent","value":"<p>Daddy Moo leads with actions, showing children that what we do matters more than what we say.</p>","segment":null}]},{"contentTypeKey":"e1a00005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","key":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006","values":[{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","alias":"accordionTitle","value":"Responsibility and Care","segment":null},{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","alias":"accordionContent","value":"<p>He takes care of the family and the Island, modelling everyday responsibility.</p>","segment":null}]},{"contentTypeKey":"e1a00005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","key":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007","values":[{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","alias":"accordionTitle","value":"Staying Calm in Difficult Moments","segment":null},{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","alias":"accordionContent","value":"<p>When things go wrong, Daddy Moo keeps a cool head and finds a steady way forward.</p>","segment":null}]},{"contentTypeKey":"e1a00005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","key":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008","values":[{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","alias":"accordionTitle","value":"Helping Others","segment":null},{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","alias":"accordionContent","value":"<p>He's always ready to lend a hoof, teaching kindness through quiet, practical help.</p>","segment":null}]}],"settingsData":[],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005"},{"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006"},{"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007"},{"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008"}]},"expose":[{"culture":null,"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","segment":null},{"culture":null,"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006","segment":null},{"culture":null,"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007","segment":null},{"culture":null,"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008","segment":null}]}]]></Value>
